    "Install clangd for C/C++/Objective-C support:\n\n  brew install llvm\n\nOr install Xcode Command Line Tools:\n\n  xcode-select --install" : {
      "comment" : "clangd install guidance",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installieren Sie clangd für die Unterstützung von C/C++/Objective-C:\n\n  brew install llvm\n\nOder installieren Sie die Xcode Command Line Tools:\n\n  xcode-select --install"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instala clangd para tener soporte de C/C++/Objective-C:\n\n  brew install llvm\n\nO instala las Command Line Tools de Xcode:\n\n  xcode-select --install"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installez clangd pour la prise en charge de C/C++/Objective-C :\n\n  brew install llvm\n\nOu installez les Command Line Tools de Xcode :\n\n  xcode-select --install"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installa clangd per il supporto di C/C++/Objective-C:\n\n  brew install llvm\n\nOppure installa gli Xcode Command Line Tools:\n\n  xcode-select --install"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "C/C++/Objective-C をサポートするには、clangd をインストールしてください:\n\n  brew install llvm\n\nまたは Xcode コマンドラインツールをインストール:\n\n  xcode-select --install"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Для поддержки C/C++/Objective-C установите clangd:\n\n  brew install llvm\n\nИли установите Xcode Command Line Tools:\n\n  xcode-select --install"
          }
        }
      }
